*Solution Steps Walkthrough:*
1. Formulate the characteristic equation $det([T] - lambda I) = 0$ and solve for eigenvalues.
2. For the eigenvalue $lambda = 1$, find the eigenspace by solving $([T] - I)bold(v) = 0$.
3. Determine the equation of the line representing this eigenspace.
